# The dApp reads the Vite env files of the client directory, i.e. client/.env*.
# The template lives in client/.env.example; copy it to client/.env.local or let
# `./tools/localnet.sh deploy` generate client/.env.local for you.
#
# Only public test values belong there: Anvil development keys are publicly
# known. Never put real private keys, seed phrases or passwords in any .env file.

